-- Narrow facts (docs/PRIVILEGED_AUDIT.md): counts, codes and anonymous figures of rows the caller's RLS hides; side effects in another party's feed.
-- Generated by scripts/gen-schema.mjs from packages/domain/src/store/sql/facts.ts. Do not edit by hand:
